      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Aliases should be displayed after non-aliases. Since we have fuzzy search [*], we could match in this order:\r\n\r\n- Exact matches (non-aliases)\r\n- Exact matches (aliases)\r\n- Fuzzy search (any, assuming it sorts by some \"similarity\" index)\r\n\r\nIf we get #82000, then we could even do:\r\n\r\n- Exact matches (non-aliases)\r\n- Exact matches (Rust aliases)\r\n- Exact matches (non-Rust aliases)\r\n- Fuzzy search (any, assuming it sorts by some \"similarity\" index)\r\n\r\n[*]\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/23638587/107890698-468c4d00-6ee8-11eb-85ed-ea2428ec6d1d.png)",
